> shvar(x: i8, n: i8 in -2..9) = x << n
> domain shvar
domain of shvar:
  x: i8, -128..127
  n: i8, -2..9
  requires 0 <= n < 8  (shift amount; C UB otherwise)
  C assumes x << n does not overflow  (signed shift)
  defined at 2048 of 3072 points
  undefined e.g. at x=-128, n=-2; x=-127, n=-2; x=-126, n=-2; x=-125, n=-2
